cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the article below (preferred) and/or
  this software.
title: "pytest-smartpar: dependency-aware parallel execution of unit tests in CI"
type: software
version: 0.1.0.dev0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  pytest plugin implementing a method for parallel execution of unit tests in
  continuous integration systems: profiling of file access and process state,
  detection of order-dependent tests, grouping by Bernstein's conditions and
  confirmed order dependencies, LPT scheduling on pytest-xdist workers.
keywords:
  - pytest
  - parallel testing
  - continuous integration
  - order-dependent tests
  - LPT scheduling
authors:
